# 9. KEYBOARD ACCESSIBILITY

Audit the entire existing experience.

Ensure:

* interactive elements can be reached with Tab
* focus states are clearly visible
* Enter activates appropriate controls
* Escape closes overlays/drawers
* mega menu behaves correctly
* search suggestions are keyboard navigable
* mobile/navigation dialogs can be exited with Escape where appropriate

Do not remove browser focus outlines unless replacing them with an equally visible custom focus state.

---

# 10. MOBILE AUDIT

Check the existing pages at narrow mobile widths.

Specifically look for:

* horizontal scrolling
* overflowing product names
* broken buttons
* oversized images
* cramped quantity controls
* specification tables overflowing
* filters becoming unusable
* mega menu overflow
* basket layout breaking
* long SKU values breaking layouts

Fix actual issues rather than redesigning mobile.

---

